  <item>
    <title>A股是最好的市场</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/640ffb2c8be5d400130fe9e9</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">640ffb2c8be5d400130fe9e9</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 14 Mar 2023 04:42:19 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>这期音频在剪辑的时候，传来美国硅谷银行一夜间轰然倒塌的消息，这让我回想起2008年雷曼兄弟倒闭的那个时刻，那时的我还在读初中，并不知道这件事情意味着什么。转眼间15年过去了，因为工作的原因我和炸鸡对A股、对投资有了更深的了解和认知，也越发感觉到A股市场无论是从制度、发展、回报等各个角度来看，都有自己得天独厚的优势所在。这一期，我们跟躺赢一起用数据和经验的角度来聊聊我们又爱又“恨”的大A股。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期嘉宾：</span></strong><span>@躺赢君（</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ede84ed418a84a046ab207e?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTI2N2I3ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmJmNjQzNCJ9" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/5ede84ed418a84a046ab207e?s=eyJ1IjogIjVmOTI2N2I3ZTBmNWU3MjNiYmJmNjQzNCJ9"><span>躺赢人生</span></a><span>主播，欢迎订阅）</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>主播：</span></strong><span>炸鸡@炸鸡只爱蒜香味、老卓@Echo卓</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>品牌视觉：</span></strong><span>小红@九個9</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期你会听到：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="200">3:20</a> 居然有人说crypto再差也比A股强，我们不服；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="655">10:55</a> 躺赢的扎心一问，我们承认还亏着；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="840">14:00</a> 沪深300指数过去15年年化居然做到了10%！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1320">22:00</a> A股波动大为啥是好事呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1500">25:00</a> 说A股是赌场的，怕是不知道A股每年为股东赚了多少钱</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1840">30:40</a> 房产、现金、国债、黄金，通通不如股票？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2229">37:09</a> 信息透明这件事，没啥比A股做得更好</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2520">42:00</a> 没有涨跌板，ICU人数得暴增</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2956">49:16</a> 量化为主的美股市场，散户岌岌可危</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3646">60:46</a> 普通人怎么把握住机遇？</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期出现的一些数据（出自躺赢的整理）</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ftgaj08A4z4LHYrbO0cBjrvwZeWb.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FofD4n5HqVq3vNGwG7QZ0MNWnUke.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq3DgQwfWWjATGLmN0A8fFoeh2zC.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq2hErzvNoqjm5viAkdmGSq821Ee.jpg"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvYsE95NpP_wZusNjA5awJXomAPv.png"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>BGM：</span></strong><span>《110515》、《生活在别处》</span></p>]]></description>
